{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not enter this game and match the characters. The characters in the game are over 18 years old, and the world view and story characters are fictional. Any similarities are purely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention: This game involves a large number of proprietary terms related to music games. Please follow the guidance of music game players and play with a fun mindset. It is not recommended to excessively immerse yourself in it. Those who mind should play with caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, the game is in the demo version stage, and the following descriptions are specific content descriptions of the demo version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 20xx, arcade music games began to take root and sprout in small county towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Xiazhe, whose tablet was smashed by his family due to his addiction to music games, chose to come to a small county town alone to study. However, he found that he could hardly find classmates who shared his interests in school. Once upon a time, Liu Xiazhe also longed to have companions who shared his interests and hobbies, and even a partner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until his sophomore year, Liu Xiazhe, who was passionate about music games, unexpectedly came across a unique arcade music game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From then on, Liu Xiazhe began to associate with four music enthusiast girls with different personalities ..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel game with real life as its theme, tailored for professionals in the music industry with special stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the following gameplay options are also provided:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring system. Players can obtain ratings through options or music games, and the value of the ratings will affect the direction of the plot and ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074910/extras/d1b79c1e077dada7ae87b5ba0e02b56f.avif?t=1760411988\" width=712 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone mode. In Phone mode, players can chat with the characters in the game. In addition, they can also view relevant forum posts to learn about various information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074910/extras/eb6a375ede4563e3cb501b0ac7e1c7e7.poster.avif?t=1760411988\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074910/extras/eb6a375ede4563e3cb501b0ac7e1c7e7.webm?t=1760411988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074910/extras/eb6a375ede4563e3cb501b0ac7e1c7e7.mp4?t=1760411988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music games. In the plot, a music game will be set up for players to play, and they can play together with in-game characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074910/extras/eec7dcd0a8f0d91859223b10c90c8b81.poster.avif?t=1760411988\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074910/extras/eec7dcd0a8f0d91859223b10c90c8b81.webm?t=1760411988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai